{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46216","headline":"陪冯使君游六首 登干霄亭 · 贯休","name":"陪冯使君游六首 登干霄亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥翠扪萝山屐轻，飘颻红斾在青冥。\n仙科朱绂言非贵，溪鸟林泉癖爱听。\n古桂林边棊局湿，白云堆里茗烟青。\n因思庐岳弥天客，手把金书倚石屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}